{"product":{"id":10098137137480,"title":"Mid-Century Convertible Sofa by Opp Drevovyroba, 1970s","body_html":"This convertible sofa is a practical example of Czechoslovak mid-century design, manufactured by Opp Drevovyroba during the 1970s. The sofa converts easily into a bed with a single quick flip mechanism, making it a versatile space-saving solution for a living room or guest room. With a width of 200 cm and a depth ranging from 87 cm (sofa position) to 131 cm (bed position), it offers generous seating or sleeping space depending on configuration.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCondition \u0026amp; Character\u003cbr\u003eOriginal condition with signs of use and fading consistent with age. The upholstery shows age-appropriate fading and general signs of use over the decades. The sofa converts to its bed position with one quick flip; please note that due to the wear of the seating, the bed surface does not lie fully flat, though this is easily addressed with cushions or a topper. Please review the detailed photos to inspect the exact cosmetic condition and fading before purchasing.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDetails \u0026amp; Dimensions\u003cbr\u003eStyle: Mid-Century Modern\u003cbr\u003eManufacturer: Opp Drevovyroba\u003cbr\u003eOrigin: Czechoslovakia\u003cbr\u003ePeriod: 1970s\u003cbr\u003eType: Convertible Sofa Bed\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: W200 x D87\/131 cm x H81 cm\u003cbr\u003eSeat Height: 39 cm\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLocated in Budapest, Hungary. Europe-wide delivery available — contact for a shipping quote. For similar style pieces, checkout our other listings as well.","vendor":"justchairs.eu","product_type":"","created_at":"2026-06-15T19:56:49+02:00","handle":"mid-century-convertible-sofa-by-opp-drevovyroba-1970s","updated_at":"2026-10-03T18:09:42+02:00","published_at":"2026-06-15T19:57:10+02:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"web","tags":"sofas","variants":[{"id":53296981246280,"product_id":10098137137480,"title":"Default Title","price":"15